:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen flips again, now off to Oklahoma","description":"Five-star safety prospect Peyton Bowen, who previously flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon, has flipped once again, signing with Oklahoma Sooners, he announced on Twitter on Thursday.","published":"2024-01-23T16:02:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/35306416/five-star-safety-peyton-bowen-flips-again-now-oklahoma","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Blake Baumgartner","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen flips from Notre Dame to Oregon","description":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen, the No. 14 overall prospect in the 2023 ESPN 300, has flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon on national signing day.","published":"2024-01-15T20:32:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/35298055/five-star-safety-peyton-bowen-flips-notre-dame-oregon","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Blake Baumgartner","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oregon RB Dierre Hill Jr. limps off with injury in win vs. Michigan State","description":"Oregon running back Dierre Hill Jr. limped off the field with an injury in the first quarter against Michigan State on Friday night.","published":"2026-11-21T05:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50545816/oregon-running-back-dierre-hill-exits-vs-michigan-state-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Revised Protect College Sports Act allows conferences to expand up to 22 schools","description":"Federal lawmakers published a revised version of the Protect College Sports Act on Friday as the U.S. House of Representatives prepares to push for a vote during the first week of December. President Donald Trump also voiced his support for the bill.","published":"2026-11-21T02:51:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50545220/protect-college-sports-act-revised-donald-trump-voices-support","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Dan Murphy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football games this weekend: Top 25 schedule","description":"Here's what to know about the college football slate for the Top 25 this weekend.","published":"2026-11-20T21:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542897/college-football-games-top-25-schedule-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-20T20:45:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-20T20:32:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-20T19:00:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Draft buzz: Interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could spur draft trade","description":"If the Titans or Chargers wind up with the No. 1 selection and stick with their franchise quarterbacks, interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870625/peyton-bowen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Peyton Bowen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen","description":"American football cornerback (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:34:50Z","intro":"Peyton Bowen (born March 1, 2004) is an American college football safety for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bowen grew up in Denton, Texas. He attended and played high school football at John H. Guyer High School. He intercepted 12 passes and broke up 23 passes in three varsity seasons at Guyer.\n\nRECRUITMENT\nBowen was rated a five-star recruit by ESPN and initially committed Notre Dame over offers from Alabama, Oklahoma, and USC. He later flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon. However, the following day Bowen changed his commitment a second time and signed his National Letter of Intent to play at Oklahoma. He later explained that his decision was due to a paperwork issue as Oregon had not sent him a letter of intent to sign before the start of the early signing period."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Bowen joined the Oklahoma Sooners as an early enrollee in January 2023. He entered the season as the team's second-string safety."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Eli Bowen","description":"American football player","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)"}]}}